      "subject": "Theetšang le nna",
      "rationale": "Go bitšwa ga balaodi ba Shekeme go theeletša — go mošomo wa go buleng pafingo ya Yotame."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "balaodi ba Shekeme",
      "rationale": "Tshupetšo ya go lebana: Yotame o bolela go balaodi ba Shekeme go thaba ya Gerizime."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "theetšang \/ a theetše",
      "rationale": "Šupo ya go theetša e bušetšwa: 'le nna le theetše, gore Elohim a le theetše' — kgwelediano ya kahlolo, go laela ga Seheberu ga se fetele go Sepedi."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme ba mo boletše Yotame, gomme a ya, a ema mothaloding wa thaba ya Gerizime, mme a tseglela lentšu la gagwe, a bilela, mme a re go bona: Theetšang le nna, balaodi ba Shekeme, gore le lona Elohim a le theetše.",
